From 18cb155ce7d424055596b2244a75bc45e5952d02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hanif <hanifmutaz@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 22:07:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: recycle bin - registry hilang & partQueries kepakai
 konten service

Backend crash total pas startup - recycleBinRegistry.js gak ke-push
padahal recycleBinService.js require file itu (app.js -> routes/index.js
-> recycleBinRoutes -> recycleBinController -> recycleBinService, semua
di-require eager di top-level app.js).

partQueries.js juga ketimpa isi partService.js (duplikat listParts/
createPart/updatePart/deletePart) - fungsi query-layer asli (findAll,
findById, create, update, remove, dst) hilang, bikin seluruh modul Parts
(list/create/edit/delete + lookup barcode PM Part) error.

lineQueries.js/supplierQueries.js/roleQueries.js/clMappingQueries.js/
partSupplierQueries.js belum ke-update ke soft-delete (remove(id,
runner) versi lama, hard DELETE, tanpa filter deleted_at) padahal
service masing-masing sudah manggil remove(id, userId, client) 3
argumen - bikin tombol Hapus di Lines/Suppliers/Roles/CL-Mapping/
Part-Supplier link crash (userId kepasang jadi runner).
